ier/commit/4ba315db37144a6f38dcd3fa5437dd346df990d2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">4ba315d</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Deploy pipeline (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2145\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2145</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7cca19d11d94d200f681da0e12dbb9638761a9fb\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7cca19d</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-tractor-refactor\"></a>🚜 Refactor&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-tractor-refactor\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">IsHelper class renamed to HttpHelper (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2160\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2160</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/c97dd8e0dcefd37346e09c1796c3c87d334fca8f\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">c97dd8e</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-gear-miscellaneous\"></a>⚙️ Miscellaneous&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-gear-miscellaneous\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Updated README (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2157\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2157</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/6d152e81c32c3c514d4a496bcbef4edc77b1a45a\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">6d152e8</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Moved scripts into scripts folder (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2156\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2156</a>) 